Subject: [PATCH] Disable Mainline RescueParty using the original UN1CA policy

The One UI 9 observer's boot-loop and package-failure callbacks all use this
bridge. Keep the Mainline service, watchdog, rollback observer, flags and
factory-reset policy intact; port the original unconditional disable hook.

diff --git a/smali/com/android/server/RescueParty.smali b/smali/com/android/server/RescueParty.smali
--- a/smali/com/android/server/RescueParty.smali
+++ b/smali/com/android/server/RescueParty.smali
@@ -125,9 +125,7 @@
 .method static bridge synthetic -$$Nest$smisDisabled()Z
     .locals 1
 
-    invoke-static {}, Lcom/android/server/RescueParty;->isDisabled()Z
-
-    move-result v0
+    const/4 v0, 0x1
 
     return v0
 .end method
